    "body": "Stopped before claim. The required S2 kernel (#2627) is not on `upstream/main` `744c0847b`.\n\n- `Cargo.toml` and `crates/` have no `camcraft-gpu` crate on `upstream/main`.\n- `crates/ui/src/trace.rs` still uploads CPU cut buffers through `TracePass::write_cut` and `TracePass::write_cut_patch`.\n- Blocker #2611 is closed (PR #2644).\n- Blocker #2627 remains open with no claim, no branch, and no open PR.\n- Issue #2620 (which blocks #2627) remains open and `claimed` on branch `issue/2620-gpu-compute-seam`, with no open PR to stack on.\n- Open PR #2714 touches `crates/app/src/stock_play.rs` and `crates/app/src/stock_view.rs`, and does not provide S2.\n\nS3 (#2629) requires the S2 kernel (#2627) and `CAMCRAFT_GPU_COMPUTE=off` (#2620). Adding S2 and `camcraft-gpu` here exceeds the scope of #2629.\nThis run made no claim, branch, worktree, code change, or test run.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
